  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fondo de Inversiones Sociales</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Investment Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE OF THE PROGRAM IS TO PROMOTE INVESTMENTS IN BASIC SOCIAL SERVICES FOR LOW-INCOME GROUPS IN RURAL AREAS, THROUGH SUPPORT OF THE SOCIAL INVESTMENT FUND (FIS). THE FIS IS AN AUTONOMOUS GOVERNMENTAL INSTITUTION, WHOSE MAIN OBJECTIVE IS TO CHANNEL RESOURCES FOR SOCIAL INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECTS TO IMPROVE THE HEALTH, NUTRITION, AND BASIC EDUCATION OF LOW INCOME GROUPS IN RURAL AREAS OF THE COUNTRY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
